    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῠσ-άλωτος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hard to catch</i> or <i>take</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ly.</u>
					206a
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); of birds and fish, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				615a17
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				599b25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.133
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>hard to conquer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					167
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Abd.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			 (
				Sup.
			); <i>immune</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἔξωθεν αἰτίοις δ. σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					4.742
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς νόσους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			): c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κακῶν</span>
			<i>beyond reach</i> of ills, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1723
			</span></i>(lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hard to comprehend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				51a
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			).</div>
